                                                "sense_id": "1836388e-6c65-351a-b253-26b16abde286",
                                                "text": "Conservative movements were far more progressive than the standard religious narrative of the decade alleges and the notoriously progressive ethos of the era was far more conservative than our collective memory has recognized."
